# Environment Variables Template
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your actual values

## Supabase Configuration
# Get these values from: https://supabase.com/dashboard > Your Project > Settings > API

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

## Usage Notes:
# - EXPO_PUBLIC_ prefix makes variables accessible in the app via expo-constants
# - These variables are embedded at build time, not runtime
# - For EAS builds, use eas.json secrets
# - Never commit the .env file to git

## R2 Storage Configuration
# Cloudflare R2 values for file storage
EXPO_PUBLIC_R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your-r2-access-key-id
EXPO_PUBLIC_R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your-r2-secret-access-key
EXPO_PUBLIC_R2_ENDPOINT=https://your-account-id.r2.cloudflarestorage.com
EXPO_PUBLIC_R2_BUCKET_NAME=your-bucket-name
